{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/extras/3544c8bcf60d8e6129983895413d6fa1.webp?t=1768557658\" width=600 height=51 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An abandoned school at midnight... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players split into two roles: &quot;Hiders&quot; and &quot;Oni (Seeker),&quot; facing off in fast-paced, three-minute rounds. Your only lifeline is the flashlight in your hand. Read the shifting light and shadows, listen for sounds, sense presences\u2014hold your breath, run, and escape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this is no ordinary game of KAKUREONI -a deadly game of hide-and-seek. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something inhuman lurks in the darkness\u2014 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a third presence that will never side with the living. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the story of children, spirited away into the night, struggling to find their way back home to their families. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/extras/97ad424eb857b569411daad17cda8d27.webp?t=1768557658\" width=1560 height=24 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/extras/43d9483fb455ff77939586000f1db484.webp?t=1768557658\" width=600 height=51 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c63-Minute High-Speed Rounds \u2013 Tense, replayable matches you can experience again and again. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Asymmetrical Multiplayer Horror \u2013 Two sides with different roles: Hiders and Oni (Seeker), each with unique thrills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Light and Sound Mind Games \u2013 Flashlight beams, flickers, reflections, footsteps, even breathing can give you away. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Walkie-Talkie Communication \u2013 Exclusive to Hiders, but beware\u2026 ghosts may be listening nearby. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6A Third Threat \u2013 An otherworldly being roams the map, mixing patterns and randomness to disrupt the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Fragments of the Story \u2013 Clues gathered between rounds piece together the night of the disappearance. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Thrill in Spectator Mode \u2013 Even after being caught, you can spectate and share the tension with others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Coordinate with Your Team Using Walkie-Talkies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/extras/95d82bda7d3e8ea01c2d243aec2fed59.poster.avif?t=1768557658\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/extras/95d82bda7d3e8ea01c2d243aec2fed59.webm?t=1768557658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Kakure Oni</strong>, human players can talk to each other using walkie-talkies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cOver here!\u201d \u201cWatch out!\u201d \u2014 calling out to your teammates and moving in sync is the key to escaping safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>But be careful\u2026 using a walkie-talkie when a ghost is nearby might lead to something unexpected.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Buy Mysterious Dagashi Snacks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/extras/5a82da9caf58c262aa645e9452e94f8c.poster.avif?t=1768557658\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/extras/5a82da9caf58c262aa645e9452e94f8c.webm?t=1768557658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before the game begins, human players can spend their allowance to buy <strong>dagashi</strong> snacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dagashi sold by the old lady are packed with strange and mysterious effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use them at the right moment, and you can turn the tide of the match in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ghosts That Lurk in the School</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/extras/b7b974cfee2132292bd4835c93b3bd38.poster.avif?t=1768557658\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/extras/b7b974cfee2132292bd4835c93b3bd38.webm?t=1768557658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988220/extras/b7b974cfee2132292bd4835c93b3bd38.mp4?t=1768557658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The school isn\u2019t home to just humans and Oni \u2014 countless vengeful spirits wander its halls as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These spirits side with the Oni and interfere with the humans\u2019 escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humans can detect spirits using <strong>Spirit Sight</strong>, but Oni can see them at all times, making things far from simple.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3988220?t=1768557658","backgro