64f/ss_c38d69f678968cfa17a2ea16316cec861113364f.600x338.jpg?t=1768557658"}],"short_description":"This is an asymmetrical multiplayer horror game. Deep within pitch-black ruins, with only the beam of a flashlight to guide you, the children must play KAKUREONI -a deadly game of hide-and-seek- to bring an end to the ritual of reincarnation.","steam_appid":3988220,"support_info":{"email":"support@forces.co.jp","url":""},"supported_languages":"Japanese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}